      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The sales agent was very knowledgeable about the products and listened to my particular needs, then recommended a product to suit. As I was doing some renovations to my roof, I had to liaise with the solar company to suit the time I needed to have the solar system installed, this was done without any hassle.The installation was done very well; the installers were on time, polite, they were able to get the system installed within a day and once it was installed the area was spotless. I was taken through how to configure the apps and how to understand the light system on the inverter to ensure it is operating correctly. The panel install was configured as I had requested.Everything was organised by the solar company with great communication, they organised the grid connection which required an upgraded meter. Would happily recommend them to others and are most probably going to use the same company to install a battery backup system next year.",
