      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Where do you find a team of workers that are well presented, professional, hard working, efficient and skilled? Well Sun City Solar sent this team to my property to install a Solar system. I remain amazed at how conscientious and safety orientated they were. Disciplined, well mannered, polite and respectful through every aspect of the installation with an outstanding leader/electrician who impressed me incredibly with his astute leadership and communication skills.This outstanding attitude also existed in my dealings with Office staff and initial contact with Sun City Solar, and I congratulate all for the service given me.",
