      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The process of changing out our older solar system for a larger new system went about as smoothly as you could expect in a country location. The quotes obtained and the dealings with the different providers was a bit of a convoluted effort. In the end we made our choice based upon the equipment more so than the price. The installation date was mutually agreed and the provider Sun City Solar folks arrived at the stated time. The installation had its challenges but all these were met and overcome by the guys doing the install. The job was completed in good time with a minimum of fuss and the place was left neat and tidy. The information provided by the guys was sufficient to get us started with the on-line aspects of this system.  The price was a bit more than I had planned for, but I guess you get what you pay for.......or at least I live in hope!As for the company we chose, Sun City Solar, they have done everything they said they would do.I would be happy to recommend them.",
